{"chars": "The Library of Lost Winters is the oldest room at the North Pole. It is tall and round, like the inside of a tower, and its walls are covered from floor to ceiling with books. Big books and tiny books. Fat books and skinny books. Books bound in red leather and green velvet and soft gray birch bark. Some are so old that their pages have turned the color of toast. The shelves go up so high that the top ones disappear into shadow, and to reach them there are tall wooden ladders that roll along brass rails. Rrrrrumble go their little wheels.", "start": [0.2, 0.2, 0.2, 0.3, 0.3, 0.3, 0.3, 0.3, 0.3, 0.3, 0.3, 0.738, 0.738, 0.738, 0.85, 0.85, 0.85, 0.85, 0.85, 1.125, 1.125, 1.125, 1.125, 1.125, 1.125, 1.125, 1.125, 1.613, 1.613, 1.613, 1.738, 1.738, 1.738, 1.738, 1.863, 1.863, 1.863, 1.863, 1.863, 1.863, 1.863, 2.25, 2.25, 2.25, 2.25, 2.25, 2.462, 2.462, 2.462, 2.538, 2.538, 2.538, 2.538, 2.625, 2.625, 2.625, 2.625, 2.625, 2.625, 2.9, 2.9, 2.9, 2.9, 2.9, 3.625, 3.725, 3.725, 3.725, 3.837, 3.837, 3.837, 3.987, 3.987, 3.987, 3.987, 3.987, 4.35, 4.35, 4.35, 4.35, 4.475, 4.475, 4.475, 4.475, 4.475, 4.475, 5.025, 5.1, 5.1, 5.1, 5.1, 5.1, 5.237, 5.237, 5.237, 5.237, 5.35, 5.35, 5.35, 5.35, 5.35, 5.35, 5.35, 5.812, 5.812, 5.812, 5.888, 5.888, 5.987, 5.987, 5.987, 5.987, 5.987, 5.987, 6.675, 6.775, 6.775, 6.775, 6.775, 6.888, 6.888, 6.888, 6.888, 7.025, 7.025, 7.025, 7.025, 7.025, 7.025, 7.312, 7.312, 7.312, 7.312, 7.4, 7.4, 7.4, 7.4, 7.4, 7.4, 7.4, 7.4, 7.725, 7.725, 7.725, 7.725, 7.725, 7.938, 7.938, 7.938, 7.938, 7.938, 7.938, 8.25, 8.25, 8.25, 8.387, 8.387, 8.387, 8.387, 8.387, 8.387, 8.387, 8.387, 8.738, 8.738, 8.738, 8.738, 8.738, 8.9, 8.9, 8.9, 8.9, 8.9, 8.9, 9.625, 9.725, 9.725, 9.725, 9.725, 9.95, 9.95, 9.95, 9.95, 9.95, 9.95, 10.213, 10.213, 10.213, 10.213, 10.325, 10.325, 10.325, 10.325, 10.325, 10.65, 10.65, 10.65, 10.65, 10.65, 10.65, 11.275, 11.387, 11.387, 11.387, 11.387, 11.675, 11.675, 11.675, 11.675, 11.675, 11.675, 11.95, 11.95, 11.95, 11.95, 12.075, 